  "chitchat": [
    "\"Do you know who decides where the pitches go?\"",
    "looks at the empty pitches and then at the people near them."
  ],
  "description": "A young man sitting on a holdall at the Overspill with everything he owns in it. He came in through the South Gate this morning and is waiting for somebody to say where he can pitch.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "ask": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Right.",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Down the coast road. There was work, and then there wasn't. Somebody on the truck said there was room here.\""
    },
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "Tariq sits back down on his holdall."
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Where did you come from?",
          "next": "ask"
        },
        {
          "label": "Bye.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Hi,\" says Tariq.",
      "text_by_relation": {
        "familiar": "\"I got a pitch. Third one along. Thanks for asking.\"",
        "first": "The young man on the holdall stands up quickly.\n\n\"Sorry. Tariq. I just got here. Do you know who I ask about a pitch?\"",
        "known": "\"I got a pitch. Third one along. Thanks for asking.\""
